...and that is all. From here on out, all further configuration is considered
too specific on the individual use case to be covered by this script.
Nevertheless, here are some tips on how to further set up your system:
    - installing display drivers for your GPU
    - setting up a Wayland compositor, window manager or desktop environment
    - creating a user directory base structure with xdg-user-dirs
    - installing an AUR helper
    - installing Emacs